  fhir:DomainResource.text [
     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "generated" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : CarteDeConcepts measurement-condition-to-snomed</b></p><a name=\"measurement-condition-to-snomed\"> </a><a name=\"hcmeasurement-condition-to-snomed\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p>Mapping de <a href=\"CodeSystem-measurement-condition.html\">TAUSSIG — Condition de mesure</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-snomedct.html\">SNOMED CT (all versions)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td>resting (Repos)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>263678003 (au repos)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>exercise (Effort)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>128976003 (état à l'effort)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>pharmacologic_stress (Stress pharmacologique)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>428813002 (épreuve de stress pharmacologique)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>supplemental_o2 (Oxygène)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td>57485005 (oxygénothérapie)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>nitric_oxide (Monoxyde d'azote)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td>6710000 (monoxyde d'azote)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>room_air (Air ambiant)</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)